comments.body:
Consider taking `LOCK(wallet.cs_wallet)` before the `IsLocked()` check rather than after key generation.
It matches the existing convention in the wallet RPCs, where LOCK(`pwallet->cs_wallet`) is consistently taken before `EnsureWalletIsUnlocked(*pwallet)` (e.g. `signmessage.cpp`, `backup.cpp`, `spend.cpp`).

